# One account per line. Copy to users.txt; install.sh reads it and keeps
# USERS= in .env in agreement.
#
# Names may use a-z, 0-9 and '_' only, up to 24 characters. No '-': client
# emails are namespaced per lane as r-<name> / t-<name> / h-<name>, and the
# consolidation step recovers <name> by splitting on the first '-'.
#
# Removing a name here does NOT delete the account - it only stops install.sh
# from re-creating it. Delete the client in the panel to actually revoke access.

alice
bob
carol
